From 2c68336e30d21acfc6fd484e30d52552660ffadf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Feickert <matthew.feickert@cern.ch>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 20:29:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs: Document per-feature optional statistics
 dependencies

* In the requirements sections of README.md and Installation_TLDR.txt,
  list numpy and scipy as required for the statistical evaluation and
  spell out which optional packages each multibin mode needs:
  pyhf (and jsonpatch) for '-mod simple'/'-mod fullpyhf', spey and
  spey-pyhf for '-mod full', and ROOT >= 6.32.14 with XRooFit for
  analyses with hs3 likelihoods. Note that a plain CheckMATE run works
  without any of them.

